<title>UK: DEUTSCHE BANK SETS WARRANTS ON DOLLAR/MARK.</title>
<headline>DEUTSCHE BANK SETS WARRANTS ON DOLLAR/MARK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, Frankfurt said it has issued</p>
<p>nine million European-style call warrants in nine equal tranches, on the</p>
<p>US$/mark exchange rate.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   14.AUG.97		 LISTING    FFURT, DUSS</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  US$/DEM  1.8876</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	STRIKE	 MATURITY	  ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	1.95	   16.MAR.98	 3.71 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	1.95	   15.JUN.98	 4.46 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	1.95	   14.SEP.98	 5.14 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	1.95	   14.DEC.98	 5.76 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	2.00	   16.MAR.98	 2.56 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	2.00	   15.JUN.98	 3.26 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	2.00	   14.SEP.98	 3.91 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	2.10	   14.DEC.98	 2.57 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	2.10	   14.DEC.98	 1.44 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
